        },
        {
          "text": "(Lino kalekale mu-Israyeli muntu naakali kuya kubuzya kwa-Leza wakaamba boobu, wati, Amuboole, atweende kumusondi, nkaambo kakuti muntu uutegwa musinsimi sunu kalekale wakali kutegwa musondi).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
